WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:48.080
What can I get you?

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.590
Milk, on the double.

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:02.100
Takao and the others won't find me here.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.100
I'll be able to focus on my work.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:13.810
We of the BBA team have managed to win the World Tournament's A-Block, earning a spot at the Final Tournament.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.650
But the real battle starts now.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:23.920
In preparation for our fights against powerful opponents to come, I need to analyze our team's weaknesses.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:29.530
Indeed. Now's the time to
look back on our past battles.

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:34.550
BBA - Miracle of the Fierce Battles!

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.360
BBA team...

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:40.050
It all began when I met with Takao.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:47.800
Yes. It happened when Hiruta from the Shellkillers came to battle with us.

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:52.440
You bastard...

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.730
I will teach you a lesson with Beyblades!

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:59.980
Sounds good. I'll take <i>your</i> Beyblade with me as well.

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:01.520
Please wait!

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:06.160
Could you please postopone this match for a while?

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.670
What's your deal? Don't get in our way!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:11.330
This is how Takao and I met.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.520
Fourfold.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:13.560
What?

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:17.980
You need a rotational speed 4 times higher than average to break though his defence.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.760
F-Four times?!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:27.680
Nevertheless, Takao managed to achieve quadruple speed with his determination and hard work.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.970
Go...

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.880
Shoot!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.950
Such a dumb trick will never work against my Beyblade!

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.620
Go!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.470
Take this!

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.700
I... I can't believe this!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.360
And that's when <i>he</i> appeared.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.080
The man who would become Takao's fated rival.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:22.950
I can't forgive someone who treats Beyblades like that! Who are you?!

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.200
Kai of the Shellkillers.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:32.300
That's right. Back then, Kai controlled a group of powerful Bladers as leader of the Shellkillers.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:35.240
And his power was...

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.390
W-What was that dragon just now?

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.440
Seiryuu and Suzaku?

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.760
What's this all about?

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:02.980
Your Bit of Seiryuu, and my Bit of Suzaku.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.440
They aren't your average Bit.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:09.680
I'm looking for the Beyblades that hold such Bits.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.810
Go... Shoot!

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:13.640
Go, Dragoon!

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:14.830
Go, Draciel!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.290
Protoshell moved!

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.030
You're mine!

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:23.520
<i>No! Look!</i>

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.100
N-No way!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:33.380
You haven't mastered Dragoon yet.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:37.710
By becoming one with Dragoon, and adding <i>variation </i>to your attacks,

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.730
only then you will really become my rival!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:43.910
Beyblade Battle Tournament?

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:50.460
A knockout competition to determine the strongest Beyblader in Japan.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:55.520
Max, Kai and Takao all passed the qualifying rounds.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:58.560
And in the first match of the semi-finals...

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.920
Max faced off against Kai.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.610
Watch me, Mama.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.410
<i>No!</i>

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:25.440
And in the second match of the semi-finals...

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:29.980
Back then, we still had no
idea of Rei's fearsome power.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.960
Go, Dragoon!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.440
I'm not going to let you do that!

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:37.200
Storm Attack!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.540
Ultimately, Takao managed to win against Rei,

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:06.320
and the tournament had finally reached its conclusion.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:14.640
Fire! After a series of intense battles,

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:19.680
this Beyblade Super Battle
Tournament has reached the climax!

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:21.610
We're about to assist to the final fight!

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:27.120
Taking part in it will be...
Kai Hiwatari and Takao Kinomiya!

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.540
Go!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.460
What?!

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.920
Wow! They're still at it!

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.200
Don't give up!

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.710
Go!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:07.760
Dragoon!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:10.150
Dranzer!

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:20.260
D-Dranzer is out!

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.530
The match is over!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:26.790
Beyblade Battle Tournament finals:

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:30.830
The winner is Takao Kinomiya!

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.740
Heck yeah!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.120
W-World Championship..?

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.450
You're surprised, I bet.

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:52.560
This tournament also was also created to choose the team members that the BBA will send to the World Championship.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:56.380
The world is full of powerful Bladers still unknown to us.

00:08:57.060 --> 00:09:01.340
I only entered this tournament after President Datenji asked.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:06.920
We wanted to know if in Japan exist Bladers strong enough to take on world-class opponents.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:11.490
After fighting you, Takao, I was sure of it.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:16.440
We can fight side by side, against the powerful opponents from around the world.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.960
Alright!

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:22.290
Kai! I see, we're going to be team mates from now on.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.270
Let's do our best.

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:25.170
Don't misunderstand.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:28.780
I never said I would become your comrade or anything.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:34.560
I'm only doing this to defeat the Beyblader that controls the strongest Sacred Beast,

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:41.060
This changes nothing. Sooner or later, I am going to fight and defeat all of your Beyblades.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:45.240
Yes... From the start, we were a team in name only.

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:50.430
But it was that moment which marked the birth of the BBA.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:07.180
The BBA didn't start under the best circumstances,

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:11.080
but something united us and
made us stronger than ever before.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.830
That something was our powerful opponents.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:20.400
The Chinese team, formed by members of the same Byakko Clan that Rei belonged to.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:23.990
They were the first powerful opponent we faced.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.690
It's been a long time, Rei.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.680
Lai...

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.800
They are the comrades you chose. I'm sure they are adequately strong.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.690
But in the end, all your efforts will be vain.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:38.200
What did you say?!

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:43.530
We will be the ones to win.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.490
Go... Shoot!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:04.120
Mao! No matter how far apart we are, we will always be comrades!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:08.900
Comrades of the Byakko Clan! The bond that connects us will never be torn apart!

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.080
That's right.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:19.950
Oh? Both of them have created some space. Are they going to fight it out?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.990
Rei-nii, I'm not going to lose!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.910
I'm not gonna lose either, Mao!

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:30.540
Finally, the battle was settled in a sudden deathmatch between Rei and Lai.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.630
Three, Two, One!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.560
Go... Shoot!

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:38.800
Go, Driger!

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.720
Tiger Claw!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.320
Do you really think that will work on me?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.770
I will show you all of my power!

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:01.150
Lai-nii, please, stop! This isn't a battle anymore!

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:01.990
Silence!

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.840
Lai-nii!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:04.840
What other choice do I have?!

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:10.600
How... How else am I supposed to calm my feelings?!

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:14.840
I'll make you regret abandoning
your clan by beating you!

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:19.180
I didn't abandon or betray my clan!

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:25.010
When I left the village, I realized how the world was full of powerful opponents.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:31.020
I realized that only by fighting them and knowing their power, I could grow as a <i>true</i> Blader!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.530
Nonsense.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:33.950
Finish him, Galeon!

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:38.400
Let me show you! This is the power of a member of the Byakko Clan who has seen the world!

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:41.410
Tiger Claw!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.040
What?!

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:13.680
T-The winner is Rei!

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:16.120
It's a miraculous comeback victory!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:18.160
You did it, Rei!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:19.810
I knew you had it in you!

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.620
Truly a miracle...

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.820
The world... is truly vast.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:30.550
Lai...

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:38.350
As the BBA team, we flew to America to fight in the
A-Block of the World Tournament being held there.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:43.130
Mama! Mama!

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.140
Max!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.640
I missed you so much, Mama!

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:52.220
I'll introduce you. This is the
Director, Doctor Judy Mizuhara.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.490
Mama, <i>you're</i> the Director?!

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:58.160
Go... Shoot!

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:03.280
Go, Drigator!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.120
Shake it off, Draciel!

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:08.280
<i>No!</i>

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:11.440
So the BBA team will <i>never</i> be able
to win against the PPB team.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:16.430
Spirit and will force can't
compete with the power of science.

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:17.460
Mama...

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:24.260
Subsequently, as ironic as it may have been, Max's mother was the Director of our next opponents—the PPB team.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:25.940
And that team...

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.510
<i>My name is Steve.</i>

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:40.020
I'm Eddie. I see you won against the second string players, but you won't be able to win against us.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.600
Oh yeah.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:46.640
M-Micheal..?

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:48.530
What a flashy entrance...

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:54.160
...was an elite team, backed
by the huge power of science.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:15:00.060
We faced off against powerful opponents from around the world and managed to win our way through.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:04.800
All for the sake of confronting the PPB team at the finals to defeat them.

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:12.670
<i>Ladies and gentlemen! </i>We're at the finals at last!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:17.520
Who will conquer the
American tournament? BBA or PPB?

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.640
The day has finally come!

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:41.080
The winner is Kinomiya! Incredible! A comeback victory in the eleventh hour!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.440
Alright!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.040
Go, Driger!

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.680
It's over.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:19.910
Go on out there, Max. You made a promise to your mother, yeah?

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:21.760
Max...

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:27.370
Please... win this battle!

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:41.520
I'm going! I'm not sure of how far I'll be able to get, but I'll give it everything I've got.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.070
Max...

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:45.520
Do your best!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:52.070
And in the end, everything was left up to Max.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:56.000
This is the pitch thrown with
every ounce of my power!

00:16:56.000 --> 00:17:01.290
Take it! Cannon Ball Maximum Attack!

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:03.300
<i>Go!</i>

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.690
You're finished!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.810
I think it's time to take you down.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:27.030
Micheal, you're a really amazing Blader. I can see why my Mama chose you.

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:31.950
I don't know if I can beat you as I am now, but I will not give up.

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:36.180
I have my friends, cheering
on me with all they have.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.180
And I have Genbu.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.440
I'll fight you... with everything I've got!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:47.750
Mama, take a look! This is my power! This is my way of fighting!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:50.100
What?

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:52.830
Go, Draciel!

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.890
What?! Are you telling me
you still intend on fighting?!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.410
You should already be way past your limit!

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.390
Why? How?!

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:16.190
W-What?!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:27.950
I will believe in our hearts!

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.840
And in my own heart!

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:46.160
No way! How could this..?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:50.450
What a fight..! What a comeback!

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:55.760
Still spinning after
taking down its opponent is Max's Draciel!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:19:01.960
And with that, the BBA
wins the World Tournament's A-Block!

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:04.400
You really did it, Max!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:07.360
You were amazing! You did it, Max!

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:13.380
I see...

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:15.480
Now I understand.

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.110
Care to explain what happened?

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:22.600
Our data analysis was flawless.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:24.870
But you still went and lost, didn't you?

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:29.320
That's wasn't an error in our analysis. We had omitted a certain factor.

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:31.830
Then you should quickly proceed to research it.

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:36.570
I don't think it's something
you can conduct research on...

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:42.320
Rather, they will discover on their own in the coming battles.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:46.300
And I plan to support them with all that I have.

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:52.560
Alright! Let's keep it up and go crazy in the World Tournament's Final Block!

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:53.690
Yeah!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.750
The BBA team...

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:59.120
Our team, coming from a small Japanese town...

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:03.010
is about to take flight to the World Tournament's biggest stage, the finals!

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:10.810
Oh my, what's wrong with me? I've suddenly let my emotions take over.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:15.940
Now, let us see the one player who grew the most over the course of these battles.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:19.740
Let's call them the BBA's MVP.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:27.670
Of course it's Takao.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:33.420
Okay then, let's see who needs to improve the most. BBA's 'Worst One', if you will.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:40.650
That one's Takao, too?!

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.470
Well, in a sense, I kind of expected it...

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.760
Ah! There he is!

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:46.320
Everybody!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:49.350
What are you doing in a place like this, Professor?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.000
We were looking all over for you.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.730
I was analyzing our...

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.640
That can wait. Let's go.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:56.530
Go... where exactly?

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:57.700
Do you need to ask?

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.210
The ship's about to sail!

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:04.040
Oh, is it that time already?

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.120
Get a grip, Professor!

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.870
How long are you going to stand there? Do you want to be left behind?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.510
We know, we know. No need to bark at us!

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:16.280
Farewell, America.

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:17.370
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:18.370
<i>Zài jiàn. </i>

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.760
And with that...

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:28.110
Okay, Russia! We're gonna go all out in the Final Tournament!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.530 --> 00:23:02.790
According to my analysis, we'll be taking a cruise ship to Russia, where the Final Tournament will take place.

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:06.320
Cruise ship (<i>gouka kyakusen</i>)...
Sounds like a tongue-twister.

00:23:06.450 --> 00:23:10.280
But while on the ship, we met with an exceptional Balder.

